OL,3,GNEWSAResidents to be given their own
OL,4,Avillage council
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of a Cheshire village have
OL,7,Fsaid that creating a new council would
OL,8,Fallow them to have more of a say about
OL,9,Flife locally.
OL,11,FCheshire West and Chester Council
OL,12,Fapproved plans for Willaston to set up
OL,13,Fa village council after a successful
OL,14,Fpetition from local residents.
OL,16,FSupporters said it would give the
OL,17,Fvillage a formal voice and bring people
OL,18,Ftogether.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
