OL,3,GNEWSAResidents to be given their own
OL,4,Avillage council
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first councillors will be elected
OL,7,Fto Willaston Village Council in May, at
OL,8,Fthe same time as other elections taking
OL,9,Fplace across Cheshire.
